13
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,520
Well, I'm going to take myself out to a movie tonight.

14
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:40,680
You want to go?

15
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,150
Really? Do we do that?

16
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:43,380
What do you mean?

17
00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:45,620
You know, we haven't spent time alone together

18
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:47,120
