22
00:00:53,610 --> 00:00:55,210
Sounds like most of my dates.

23
00:00:57,780 --> 00:01:00,610
Oh, dear Lord, get away from me, you monster!

24
00:01:01,390 --> 00:01:03,240
What is that about?

25
