37
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,800
to put a giant net over the building.

38
00:01:35,130 --> 00:01:38,200
Which is unfortunate, because I have a fear of nets.

39
00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:40,750
So movies, yes or no?

40
00:01:40,750 --> 00:01:42,390
Movies, yes.

41
00:01:42,730 --> 00:01:43,870
Great. I'll see you later.

42
00:01:43,870 --> 00:01:46,940
And remember, he's more afraid of you than you are of him.

43
00:01:46,940 --> 00:01:47,840
