67
00:03:36,350 --> 00:03:38,380
- Are we overthinking this?  - Not at all.

68
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:41,760
You're right. I'm fine. I'm wearing this.

69
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:44,660
Really? A blazer? All right.

70
00:03:50,970 --> 00:03:52,330
Yes, hello.

71
00:03:52,330 --> 00:03:54,260
