202
00:10:15,770 --> 00:10:17,900
Oh, no, no. This isn't a date, no.

203
00:10:18,540 --> 00:10:19,590
Right?

204
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:23,110
Uh... right.

205
00:10:23,110 --> 00:10:25,570
