That's a pretty big blue jay.

212
00:11:18,990 --> 00:11:20,660
One...

213
00:11:20,660 --> 00:11:21,730
Two...

214
00:11:21,730 --> 00:11:23,000
Three.

215
00:11:23,830 --> 00:11:26,770
Go! Shoo! Am-scray, ird-bay!

216
00:11:28,230 --> 00:11:29,490
Bird in the apartment!

