223
00:11:54,030 --> 00:11:56,070
Uh, can I see you for a sec over here?

224
00:11:56,070 --> 00:11:57,670
Oh, yeah. Sure. Just one sec?

225
00:11:57,670 --> 00:11:59,000
No problem.

226
00:11:59,770 --> 00:12:00,730
